    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d120-a1">

                <pb facs="0193" n="125" sameAs="frus:frus1867p1/pg125"/>

                <head>Mr. Rogers to Mr. Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-07-31"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >July</hi> 31, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to call the attention of
                    your department, to the fact that Mr. Augustine E. Costello, an American
                    citizen, was, on or about the 31st day of May last, arrested at or near
                    Dunganon, Ireland, and imprisoned, and is now held and imprisoned under the
                    “habeas corpus suspension act,” of the British government.</p>
                <pb facs="0194" n="126" xml:id="pg126"/>
                <p>I transmit herewith a duly certified proof of the citizenship of the gentleman
                    named, and request that it may be transmitted to our minister in London, and to
                    the appropriate consul in Ireland with directions for the immediate release of
                    the prisoner.</p>
                <p>I am, very respectfully, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JAMES J. ROGERS.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d120-a1-a1.xml" xpointer="d120-a1-a1"/>
            </div>
